        {
          "id": "0a6ebc9c-2197-421d-a76d-f79e8fa0b8ce",
          "name": "Download a subset of a gridded dataset",
          "request": {
            "name": "Download a subset of a gridded dataset",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves satellite, model, or reanalysis data (CDM Grid type).\n\n**Query string structure:**\n`?var1[(d1_start):(d1_stop)][(d2_start):(d2_stop)],...`\n\nDimension subscripts use parentheses for value-based indexing:\n`?sst[(2020-01-01T12:00:00Z)][(0.0)][(20.0):(50.0)][(-80.0):(-60.0)]`\n\nStride syntax: `[(start):(stride):(stop)]`\nSelect all values in a dimension: `[]`\n\nDimensions are always in the order shown by `/info/{datasetID}/index.json`\n(typically time, altitude/depth, latitude, longitude for 4-D datasets).\n\nAlways call `/info/{datasetID}/index.json` first to discover dimension\nnames, their order, and valid ranges.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "griddap",
                "{{datasetID}}.{{fileType}}"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
